{
  "//": "Files runtime/canvas2d needs in every APK (C2D-9): the bundled fonts, read by the runtime from assets/iwn/fonts/ (mapped, so store them uncompressed), and the third-party notices. Paths: 'from' relative to runtime/canvas2d, 'to' relative to the APK's assets/ directory. Consumed by the release build (release/stage-template-assets.mjs).",
